   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "b01d492",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "heading",
     "settings": {
      "title": "For professionals",
      "header_size": "p",
      "_css_classes": "gt-eyebrow"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "1da2e05",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "heading",
     "settings": {
      "title": "One membership. The checks are the product.",
      "header_size": "h1",
      "_css_classes": "gt-h1"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "5c90eb6",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>Gototherapy membership is a subscription for counsellors, psychotherapists, supervisors, coaches, trainers and training providers. It includes a person checking your registration, insurance, supervision and identity, an annual recheck, and a public profile in town, issue and online searches. Nobody pays before their checks are complete and they have been accepted. Featured placement, where offered, is always labelled and never changes verification.</p>",
      "_css_classes": "gt-answer"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ],
   "isInner": false
  },
  {
   "id": "24bdb7e",
   "elType": "container",
   "settings": {
    "content_width": "boxed",
    "flex_direction": "column",
    "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-section--flush-top",
    "flex_gap": {
     "column": "20",
     "row": "20",
     "unit": "px",
     "size": 20
    }
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "21a9dbf",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<div class=\"note-panel note-panel--placeholder\" style=\"max-width:none;margin-bottom:2rem\"><p class=\"note-panel__title\">Price required — do not publish</p><p>The membership price and whether an annual option exists have not been decided (Design System v2.0, page 18). Amounts below come from <code>data/pricing.json</code>, which mirrors Stripe Prices. Nothing on this page invents a figure.</p></div>"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "49a067e",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<!-- Functional block, kept verbatim. When the Gototherapy plugin is installed, replace with [gototherapy_pricing] -->\n<div data-page=\"pricing\">\n<div class=\"pricing-grid\">\n<article class=\"card pricing-card pricing-card--featured\" data-plan=\"membership-monthly\">\n<div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Membership</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Monthly</h2></div>\n<p class=\"pricing-card__price\" data-plan-price=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:var(--fs-small)\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\">Price required</span>Set in Stripe, mirrored in pricing.json</span></p>\n<ul class=\"pricing-card__list\">\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>A public profile once your checks are complete</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Registration, insurance, supervision and identity checked by a person, per role</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Annual recheck included</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Listed in town, issue and online searches</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Member account for profile, fees, availability and documents</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Cancel from your account at any time</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pricing-card__foot\"><a class=\"button button--primary button--block\" href=\"/join/\">Apply to join</a><p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin:.75rem 0 0;text-align:center\">Nothing is charged before acceptance.</p></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card pricing-card\" data-plan=\"membership-annual\">\n<div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Membership</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Annual</h2></div>\n<p class=\"pricing-card__price\" data-plan-price=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:var(--fs-small)\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\">Not yet offered</span>Enable in pricing.json if an annual option is decided</span></p>\n<ul class=\"pricing-card__list\">\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Everything in monthly membership</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>One payment a year</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pricing-card__foot\"><span aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"button button--ghost button--block\">Not available yet</span></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card pricing-card\" data-plan=\"featured-placement\">\n<div><p class=\"eyebrow eyebrow--ember\">Paid placement</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Featured</h2></div>\n<p class=\"pricing-card__price\" data-plan-price=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:var(--fs-small)\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\">Not yet offered</span>Enable in pricing.json when decided</span></p>\n<ul class=\"pricing-card__list\">\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Your profile in a labelled featured position on relevant searches</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Always marked “Featured, paid placement” to the person searching</li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Does not change, replace or speed up verification</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pricing-card__foot\"><span aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"button button--ghost button--block\">Not available yet</span></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ],
   "isInner": false
