        {
         "id": "c837563",
         "elType": "widget",
         "widgetType": "heading",
         "settings": {
          "title": "What every membership includes",
          "header_size": "h2",
          "_css_classes": "gt-h2"
         },
         "elements": []
        },
        {
         "id": "78368f7",
         "elType": "widget",
         "widgetType": "text-editor",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>The checks are the same whether you pay monthly or annually, and they do not change with featured placement. A person checks your entry on your professional register, sees a current insurance certificate, contacts your supervisor to confirm the arrangement, and matches your identity to the register entry. Supervisors also show their supervision training. Coaches and training providers are checked for insurance and identity, and their profiles say plainly that there is no register.</p><p>Every check is repeated once a year, and we email you before a document expires. If a check lapses and is not renewed, your profile is hidden until it is.</p><p>There are no reviews or ratings on Gototherapy, by design. Your listing is never ranked by popularity or by how much you pay.</p>",
          "_css_classes": "gt-prose"
         },
         "elements": []
        }
       ],
       "isInner": true
