   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "5ba0837",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "heading",
     "settings": {
      "title": "Questions professionals ask",
      "header_size": "h2",
      "_css_classes": "gt-h2"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "ff1125c",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "accordion",
     "settings": {
      "tabs": [
       {
        "_id": "bbf1b3b",
        "tab_title": "When do I pay?",
        "tab_content": "<p>After your checks are complete and you have been accepted. You receive an email with a link to set up membership through Stripe Checkout. Your profile is published when the first payment completes.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "a3178b6",
        "tab_title": "What happens if a payment fails?",
        "tab_content": "<p>Stripe retries the card and emails you. Your account shows the subscription as past due with a button to update your card. The exact grace period before a profile is hidden is set out in the <a href=\"/cancellation-and-refunds/\">cancellation and refunds policy</a>.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "e0e30f3",
        "tab_title": "Can I cancel?",
        "tab_content": "<p>Yes, from your account at any time. Your profile stays listed until the end of the period you have paid for. Refund terms are in the <a href=\"/cancellation-and-refunds/\">cancellation and refunds policy</a>.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "28549c4",
        "tab_title": "Does featured placement mean more verified?",
        "tab_content": "<p>No. Featured placement, when it is offered, is a labelled position on a search page. It is always marked as paid to the person searching, and it has no effect on which checks were done or what your badge says.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "88e00a4",
        "tab_title": "Do referral or commission fees apply?",
        "tab_content": "<p>No. Membership is a flat subscription. Gototherapy takes nothing per enquiry or per session.</p><div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"margin-top:.75rem\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\">Decision pending</span>Per-referral and commission-based fees may be prohibited by professional bodies. Confirm with BACP before any such model is introduced (Design System v2.0, page 18).</div>"
       }
      ],
      "selected_icon": {
       "value": "fas fa-plus",
       "library": "fa-solid"
      },
      "selected_active_icon": {
       "value": "fas fa-minus",
       "library": "fa-solid"
      }
